OL,3,GNEWSARally champion gets hero's welcome
OL,4,Ain home county
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew world rally champion Elfyn Evans
OL,7,Fhas been given a hero's welcome by
OL,8,Fhundreds of supporters at a celebration
OL,9,Fevent in his home county.
OL,11,FThe driver from Dinas Mawddwy in
OL,12,FGwynedd drove his Toyota world rally
OL,13,Fcar from the village to a stage in the
OL,14,Fmiddle of nearby Dolgellau, before
OL,15,Fmeeting fans for autographs and
OL,16,Fphotographs.
OL,18,FThe celebrations ended with a driving
OL,19,Fexhibition by Evans - where he took
OL,20,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth for a
OL,21,Fspin - in the high-powered car around
OL,22,FDolgellau's main car park.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
